# Authored (not Wiki): OSRS-style journal for quest_shilovillage (no Wiki journal transcript), from the Wiki walkthrough; stages are ShiloVillage's.
before	<col=000080>I can start this quest by speaking to <col=800000>Mosol Rei</col> outside <col=800000>Shilo Village</col> in southern <col=800000>Karamja</col>.</col>
before	
before	<col=000080>Difficulty:</col>
before	<col=800000>Intermediate</col>
