step	1	1	Authored
line	<col=000080>Mosol Rei gave me a <col=800000>Wampum belt</col> for <col=800000>Trufitus</col> in <col=800000>Tai Bwo Wannai</col>. Trufitus thinks the <col=800000>Legend of Rashiliyia</col> was kept in the vanished temple of <col=800000>Ah Za Rhoon</col>, 'Magnificence floating on water'. I should look for it somewhere between large bodies of water.</col>
step	2	2	Authored
line	<str>Mosol Rei gave me a Wampum belt for Trufitus in Tai Bwo Wannai. Trufitus thinks the Legend of Rashiliyia was kept in the vanished temple of Ah Za Rhoon.</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>I found a <col=800000>fissure</col> under a mound of earth east of Shilo Village and dropped a light into it. There is a long drop and a good anchor point for a <col=800000>rope</col>.</col>
step	3	3	Authored
line	<str>Mosol Rei gave me a Wampum belt for Trufitus in Tai Bwo Wannai. Trufitus thinks the Legend of Rashiliyia was kept in the vanished temple of Ah Za Rhoon.</str>
line	
line	<str>I found a fissure under a mound of earth east of Shilo Village and dropped a light into it.</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>I tied a rope to the fissure. Below lies the temple of <col=800000>Ah Za Rhoon</col>; I should search it for anything about <col=800000>Zadimus</col> or <col=800000>Rashiliyia</col> and show it to <col=800000>Trufitus</col>.</col>
step	4	4	Authored
line	<str>Mosol Rei gave me a Wampum belt for Trufitus in Tai Bwo Wannai. Trufitus thinks the Legend of Rashiliyia was kept in the vanished temple of Ah Za Rhoon.</str>
line	
line	<str>I found a fissure under a mound of earth east of Shilo Village and dropped a light into it.</str>
line	
line	<str>I tied a rope to the fissure and climbed down into the temple of Ah Za Rhoon.</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>I laid <col=800000>Zadimus'</col> remains to rest by the tribal statue in Tai Bwo Wannai. His spirit gave me a <col=800000>bone shard</col> and said, 'I am the key, but only kin may approach her.' I should ask <col=800000>Trufitus</col> about it.</col>
step	5	5	Authored
line	<str>Mosol Rei gave me a Wampum belt for Trufitus in Tai Bwo Wannai. Trufitus thinks the Legend of Rashiliyia was kept in the vanished temple of Ah Za Rhoon.</str>
line	
line	<str>I found a fissure under a mound of earth east of Shilo Village and dropped a light into it.</str>
line	
line	<str>I tied a rope to the fissure and climbed down into the temple of Ah Za Rhoon.</str>
line	
line	<str>I laid Zadimus' remains to rest in Tai Bwo Wannai. His spirit gave me a bone shard.</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>Trufitus says Rashiliyia's only kin was her son <col=800000>Bervirius</col>, entombed on a small island to the south-west. Something of his may let me approach her.</col>
step	6	6	Authored
line	<str>Mosol Rei gave me a Wampum belt for Trufitus in Tai Bwo Wannai. Trufitus thinks the Legend of Rashiliyia was kept in the vanished temple of Ah Za Rhoon.</str>
line	
line	<str>I found a fissure under a mound of earth east of Shilo Village and dropped a light into it.</str>
line	
line	<str>I tied a rope to the fissure and climbed down into the temple of Ah Za Rhoon.</str>
line	
line	<str>I laid Zadimus' remains to rest in Tai Bwo Wannai. His spirit gave me a bone shard.</str>
line	
line	<str>Trufitus told me of Rashiliyia's son Bervirius, entombed on an island to the south-west.</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>In the <col=800000>Tomb of Bervirius</col> I found a <col=800000>sword pommel</col>, a <col=800000>locating crystal</col> and some notes. Rashiliyia spared those who wore <col=800000>bronze necklaces</col>; the notes say her tomb lies <col=800000>north of Ah Za Rhoon</col>.</col>
step	7	7	Authored
line	<str>Mosol Rei gave me a Wampum belt for Trufitus in Tai Bwo Wannai. Trufitus thinks the Legend of Rashiliyia was kept in the vanished temple of Ah Za Rhoon.</str>
